  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Enhancement sphere (Animate Object (enhance)), base attack bonus +1.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you create an animated object out of a weapon, you may change the damage type of one slam attack to either piercing or slashing. If you choose to apply the piercing attack or slashing attack abilities to one of the object’s other slam attacks, you may choose to have it also apply to the slam attack modified through this feat for no additional cost. Finally, the first application of ranged attack only costs 1 CP.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/enhancement#toc59\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
